recommend check-in (Claude) -- the ledger is four bytes from its bound and every row reads OPEN, so the next red wants the reds_fold seat before it can be written in full. The 46 unbuilt pairs are 35 witnesses across eight lanes and fall on touch rather than in one sweep; Comlink's four proofs still have no caller, which is the lane's next agent-doable lap.
